I just want to know if she's on the plane.
That's all.

1561
01:41:10.172 --> 01:41:12.380
Mate, it's a matter of life and death.

1562
01:41:12.713 --> 01:41:14.297
No, that wasn't a threat.

1563
01:41:19.713 --> 01:41:22.380
She left the village?

1564
01:41:23.380 --> 01:41:24.213
I'll try--

1565
01:41:24.630 --> 01:41:25.713
Wait a minute...

1566
01:41:27.547 --> 01:41:29.422
She's in Beirut?

1567
01:41:30.088 --> 01:41:31.213
She left yesterday?

1568
01:41:33.422 --> 01:41:35.547
Thank you. A million thank yous.

1569
01:41:37.213 --> 01:41:38.422
Tonight's the night.

1570
01:41:39.963 --> 01:41:42.005
Hey, man. It's free.

1571
01:42:10.713 --> 01:42:13.380
Welcome to
Melbourne International Airport.

1572
01:42:13.713 --> 01:42:14.963
For security reasons,

1573
01:42:15.047 --> 01:42:17.838
please keep your luggage with you
at all times.

1574
01:42:17.922 --> 01:42:20.172
Any unattended luggage in the terminal

1575
01:42:20.255 --> 01:42:22.505
will be removed and may be destroyed.

1576
01:42:30.047 --> 01:42:31.047
Charlie.

1577
01:42:34.672 --> 01:42:35.755
Dianne.

1578
01:49:35.880 --> 01:49:38.338
♪ Sheikh has once again saved my life

1579
01:49:38.963 --> 01:49:41.297
♪ Now I get to go back to my wife♪
